EVALUATION.md §13, DECISIONS 173 (orchestrator log, M3 W1 eval calls): a loaded record's default
is evaluated as a literal's is and is `default` at its default expression, via the JSON object
that omitted it, not at the load call; a literal inside it stays a literal; an omitted optional
without default is at its field declaration; a dependent field is the branch its discriminant
selects (a ref read through, TYPES.md §11.6), located at its JSON value.
